11
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,250
¿Y cómo se arman

12
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,710
entonces estas conexiones?

13
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,290
No hace falta

14
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:12,090
