24
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:20,670
Por eso los

25
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,430
primeros años son

26
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:21,990
clave.

27
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:22,590
Desde Equipo ADIP,

28
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,270
